 10. **Notebooks**: Never modify `notebooks/`.
+11. **Region-agnostic UI**: The study-area name, extent, area, coverage dates and region presets come only from `manifest.json` (`studyArea`, `coverage`). No region name, coordinate or area may be hard-coded in `frontend/src`. The harmonization ratios are fitted per study area; re-run the pipeline before loading another region.
 
